From da239bd190a288bd071724e64fa461e5fa2c4590 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 19:58:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ci(tests): carry flaky test ids as FLAKY annotations, not
 artifacts [daveey]

Artifact storage on this repo has refused uploads since Oct 17, so the
flaky report travels as one warning annotation per test id (first line
= id, then the first attempt's failure tail). flaky_kanban.py
--from-github reads the annotations of each completed run's Run tests
jobs once and files the cards.

